WEBVTT

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.434
AG: With the help of his coaches,
Alexi has successfully taken his vision

00:21:33.458 --> 00:21:35.768
of bringing professional
coaching to the masses

00:21:35.792 --> 00:21:37.643
and made it into reality.

00:21:37.667 --> 00:21:40.434
He now leads a company of 250 employees

00:21:40.458 --> 00:21:43.601
with a global network of 2,000 coaches.

00:21:43.625 --> 00:21:47.476
He's learned to communicate more openly
and ruminate less on his own.

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:50.059
Just like in sports, it takes practice.

00:21:50.083 --> 00:21:52.976
AR: And that's something
that over the past six, seven years,

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:55.268
I've really learned
and embraced and cultivated

00:21:55.292 --> 00:21:57.559
and I like to think
that if we hadn't done that,

00:21:57.583 --> 00:21:59.643
BetterUp wouldn't be here today.

00:21:59.667 --> 00:22:02.101
AG: I joined the science
advisory board at BetterUp,